  "claim_boundary": "Development-only one-step forecasting on seven fixed-site temporal groups. Evaluation tests temporal-group transfer inside one excluded pilot dataset; it is not mobility, measured UAV traffic prediction, independent external generalization, or permission to bypass the regret safety rule."
